<p style="<%= email_style(:p) %>">Hello <%= @resource.display_name %>,</p>

<p style="<%= email_style(:p) %>">Someone asked to change the password for your WISP account. You can choose a new one with the button below.</p>

<%= email_button "Change my password", edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %>

<p style="<%= email_style(:p, :muted) %>;font-size:14px">If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email. Your password won't change unless you use the button and set a new one.</p>
